  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling access to drought-affected and hard-to-reach areas in Somalia through UNHAS and Logistics Cluster services.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this $1 million WFP project is to facilitate the provision of critical logistics support in response to additional requirements following the humanitarian system-wide scale up. To that end, WFP will enable 3,000 passengers and 300 MT of cargo to be transported via the UN Humanitarian Air Service, among other free-to-use logistics services in support of cluster operations.</narrative>
  </description>
